<table style="margin: auto; width: 100%;  background-color: #ffffff;  border-radius: 5px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px 30px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px;">
      Hello {{userAddrShort}},
      <br><br>
      The outcome of dispute #{{disputeId}} has been revealed.
      {{#isnt outcome 'Stalled'}}
        The mediator{{pluralStr}} voted to <b style="display: inline; color:white; padding:2px 5px; border-radius: 3px; background-color: #{{#eq outcome 'release'}}56d66b{{else}}DC2929FF{{/eq}};">{{outcome}}</b> the order.
      {{else}}
        The mediator{{pluralStr}} {{pluralWhereWasStr}} unable to reach a consensus. The order must be re-disputed.
      {{/isnt}}
      <br /><br />
      <div class="alert" {{> alertStyle }}>
        {{#eq outcome 'Stalled'}}
          <div style="padding: 5px 10px; ">{{> badgeInfo label='INFO' }} Proceed to the <a href="{{orderLink}}">order</a> to re-dispute</div>
        {{/eq}}
      </div>
      <br>
      {{> primaryButton this }}
      <br>
      Love, <br>
      {{app}} Team
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>


